{
  "$schema": "../../node_modules/nx/schemas/project-schema.json",
  "name": "dev-rxdb-http-server",
  "projectType": "application",
  "sourceRoot": "apps/dev-rxdb-http-server/src",
  "tags": ["node-app"],
  "//": [
    "lint / typecheck / test 由 nx.json 的插件从 eslint.config.mjs / tsconfig.json / vite.config.mts 推断，不在此重复声明。",
    "reset 是 AC#6 的「删文件重建」入口：先删库文件再建表写种子，而不是 DELETE FROM——后者留下自增状态与页碎片，两遍产物就不再逐字节相同。故事里写的 `reset seed` 两步合成这一个 target。"
  ],
  "targets": {
    "serve": {
      "continuous": true,
      "executor": "nx:run-commands",
      "options": {
        "command": "node apps/dev-rxdb-http-server/src/main.ts serve"
      }
    },
    "seed": {
      "executor": "nx:run-commands",
      "options": {
        "command": "node apps/dev-rxdb-http-server/src/main.ts seed"
      }
    },
    "reset": {
      "executor": "nx:run-commands",
      "options": {
        "command": "node apps/dev-rxdb-http-server/src/main.ts reset seed"
      }
    }
  }
}
